# Ignore all
*
# Unignore all with extensions
!*.*
.env
# Unignore all dirs
!*/
### Above combination will ignore all files without extension ###

# Build artefacts. This line matters more than it looks: the template above has no `/target`, so a
# `git add -A` once put 900 MB of incremental artefacts into the index (plan §7 step 1 was committed
# with them and had to be re-committed clean).
/target/


