# --- zen-man-rs (plan §7 step 2) ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The fixture TREE stays generated and untracked on purpose: git can only record modes 100644 /
# 100755 / 120000, so the `chmod 000` file, the unreadable directory and the FIFO cannot survive a
# commit/checkout cycle. `scripts/make-fixtures.py` is the source of truth and `cargo xtask
# contracts` regenerates the tree and compares it against tests/fixtures/tree/MANIFEST.md.
tests/fixtures/
# The GOLDENS are the opposite case: they are the frozen wire contract, and the plan's step-2
# acceptance criterion is "the Go server can be shut down forever and the suite still passes".
# They therefore must be committed even though the template above ignores `*.txt`, `*.log`, `*.json`.
# Negation rules must come last: git uses last-match-wins.
!tests/golden/
!tests/golden/**
.bash_history
